'''Fishing Nets''' are a type of {{Skill|Hunting}} tool. They can be used in [[Hunting#Water Hunting|Water Hunts]] to catch [[Attributes|Water Attribute Shards]]. Different Fishing Nets have different amounts of {{Stat|pull}}, which affects what creatures you can catch and how much damage you deal.

