== Usage ==
'''Fishing Nets''' can be used to catch [[Attributes|Water Attribute Shards]].
* {{MobSprite|Cod}}, {{MobSprite|Verdant}}, {{MobSprite|Birries}}, {{MobSprite|Sepialot}}, {{MobSprite|Goldolot}}, {{MobSprite|Coralot}}, {{MobSprite|Lotusfish}}, {{MobSprite|Azure}}, {{MobSprite|Solar}}, {{MobSprite|Ember}}, {{MobSprite|Timil}}, {{MobSprite|Salmon}}, {{MobSprite|Joydive}}s, {{MobSprite|Lumisquid}}s, and {{MobSprite|Shellwise}}s can be caught with any type of '''Fishing Net'''.
* {{MobSprite|Flipflopper}}s, and {{MobSprite|Seashine}}s require a {{Item|Medium Fishing Net}} or better.
* {{MobSprite|Spike}}s, and {{MobSprite|Water Snake}}s require a {{Item|Turbo Fishing Net}} or better.

'''Fishing Nets''' can only be used on the islands of [[Galatea]] or the {{Zone|Lotus Atoll}}. Attempting to use a '''Fishing Net''' outside of these regions displays the following message:
{{Dialogue|&cYou need to be on Galatea or Lotus Atoll to use this item!}}

